[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2760.19, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "text": "はい、もちろん大丈夫です。私にさせて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2763.109, "timestamp": "00:46:03", "text": "呪いの限界とは何かを知る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.79, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "それは私が知る必要があるからできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2766.55, "timestamp": "00:46:06", "text": "それ。わかった。私は自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2768.47, "timestamp": "00:46:08", "text": "口。だから、私はそれを知っておく必要がある。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2772.15, "timestamp": "00:46:12", "text": "しかし、私はそれを意識するだろう。ああ、いや"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.63, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "心配事。私はゲストに自由を与え、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2776.95, "timestamp": "00:46:16", "text": "コラボレーションパートナー。彼女はありのままの自分でいられる。いいえ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2778.309, "timestamp": "00:46:18", "text": "心配事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2779.91, "timestamp": "00:46:19", "text": "ああ、どうもありがとうございます。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2782.55, "timestamp": "00:46:22", "text": "実際、それはとても良い知らせです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2784.069, "timestamp": "00:46:24", "text": "時々、それが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2785.67, "timestamp": "00:46:25", "text": "言葉は実際には卑猥な言葉です。なぜなら私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2787.19, "timestamp": "00:46:27", "text": "それはごく普通の言葉だと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.03, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "「ああ、サイコはとても呪われている」と人々は言う。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.79, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "言う"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2792.043, "timestamp": "00:46:32", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.109, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "とにかく、半分は私が知らない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2799.109, "timestamp": "00:46:39", "text": "それが何を意味するのか理解してください。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2800.95, "timestamp": "00:46:40", "text": "大丈夫。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2803.306, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "stream private incoming"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2811.67, "timestamp": "00:46:51", "text": "あ、待って。何？どちらが嫌ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2813.51, "timestamp": "00:46:53", "text": "知る？私が教えてあげましょうか？する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2817.109, "timestamp": "00:46:57", "text": "私に教えてもらいたいの？私は私です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2819.99, "timestamp": "00:46:59", "text": "とてもとても幸せでとても"}]